cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or dataset, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "cosmos3-temporal-mcq: Video MCQ dataset preparation for temporal reasoning in robot manipulation"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible, CPU-only tooling that prepares a video multiple-choice question
  answering dataset for temporal reasoning and robot-manipulation understanding,
  targeting Cosmos 3 Nano and TAO Cosmos-RL. The repository covers source
  dataset auditing, caption-grounded question generation, source-video-level
  splitting with leakage prevention, TAO tao-vl-reason-v1.0 schema export, and
  automated validation. It does not train or evaluate a model, and its generated
  answers are caption-grounded candidates pending human visual verification.
